  <metadata>
    <name>Els Àngels Loop</name>
    <desc>Popular Girona cycling loop featuring the classic climb to Santuari dels Àngels chapel where Salvador Dalí got married. Two climbs through woodland and medieval villages in the Gavarres mountains.</desc>
